@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:build] source-release-inputs
Application releases MUST compile maintained source using the pinned runtime,
hash-verified dependency sources and sandboxed native builds. Working-tree deps,
_build, credentials and generated frontend bundles MUST NOT enter release inputs.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] source-release-secrets
Building and checking a release MUST require no production credentials. Runtime
configuration MUST remain deferred until application startup and packaged release
cookies MUST NOT be usable shared fleet secrets.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:build] native-and-assets-offline
Cedar MUST compile from its locked Rust sources. Dependency compilation and
asset generation MUST use prefetched inputs and MUST NOT download binaries or
dependencies during the ordinary application build.
